# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository.
#
# This is load-bearing, not cosmetic: scripts/build-client.mjs refuses to build
# a source that contains a carriage return (it wraps src/client.js verbatim into
# the browser artifact), and the unit tests assert LF-only artifacts. Without
# this, a Windows checkout converts the sources to CRLF and the client build
# fails for anyone who clones the repository.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows batch and PowerShell files are line-ending sensitive.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary assets must never be normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
